# [Landing Party Rosters](landing_rosters)

The bridge crew of the ship that answers the call. Separate from the away team: a crew
post is a label on a seat occupied by a human, and the away character is a body in the
world. This file is the first; `landing_party.amd` is the second.

Kept in its own file on purpose. `crew_load_amd` parses with `amd_crew_data` and the
story content is read with `amd_mission_data`; one file read by two parsers is a trap.

## [Erebus Watch](landing_crew)
---
crew
Race: terran
---
